WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.110
Good morning, John.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:04.810
I'm a little bit freaked out by all the dying
birds, and now that thousands of birds have

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:09.299
fallen prey to this bizarre and seemingly
unprecedented event, I have found several

00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:13.169
entirely insane theories about what happened
to them. Most of them have to do with secret

00:00:13.169 --> 00:00:19.740
government weapons programs, whether it be
acoustical or, like, very specified biological

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:25.340
weapons delivery, and I really just have to
say, those are almost the most boring conspiracy

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.580
theories I have ever heard.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.539
I’m not even going to tell you the details
of these conspiracy theories, because they’ve

00:00:29.539 --> 00:00:32.910
got no chutzpah! They take no pleasure in
their own absurdity!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:37.340
So John, I’ve put together a list of the
*voiceover* TOP 5 MOST RIDICULOUS CONSPIRACY

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:42.829
THEORIES OF ALL TIME. *weird bleh noise* Conspiracy
theories that should make these lame bird

00:00:42.829 --> 00:00:45.570
conspiracy theories feel ashamed of themselves.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:51.890
Number one: The Phantom Time Hypothesis, which
postulates that the years between 614 and

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:59.290
900-something AD never happened. A group of
people made those years up, along with everything

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.840
that ever happened during those years, and
all of the artifacts that date back to those

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.600
years. Charlemagne, for example, is of course
a fictional character. You thought this was

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.890
the year 2011? Turns out, it’s, uh, it’s
1714. Makes you feel young again.

00:01:11.890 --> 00:01:17.800
Number two: Nazi UFOs. I love this one because
you take UFOs, already a conspiracy theory,

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:22.700
and you say that, that’s not enough. Because
it turns out that Nazis had UFOs as early

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:26.860
as 1930, and before the end of World War II,
they took all their UFOs, and they put them

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:30.990
on a secret base in Antarctica. And ever since
then, those UFOs have been rummaging around

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.260
the earth, bothering country folk in their
nightgowns. Brilliant! I wish I could think

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.530
of crazy crap like that!

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:42.580
Number three: Kentucky Fried Chicken Causes
Sterility, But Only in Black Men. This prize-winner

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:46.860
dates back to the 1950s, back when the KKK
was still powerful. Colonel Sanders, rumored

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:51.460
to have been a Klansman himself, created a
secret recipe of seven herbs and spices and

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.299
a fertility agent that only sterilized black
men, while leaving white men as virile as

00:01:56.299 --> 00:01:57.659
the horn of an African rhino.

00:01:57.659 --> 00:02:03.170
Number four: Microsoft’s Secret Wingdings
of Terror. So Microsoft has this font. It’s

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:06.930
called Wingdings. It’s basically an easy
way to get clipart out of a font. You type

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:10.560
and symbols come up. For example, if you type
a capital NYC, you get this *image on screen

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:12.900
of skull and crossbones, Star of David, and
thumbs up symbols* which implies of course

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.360
that killing Jews is A-OK. It was actually
a big enough deal that when Microsoft later

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:22.050
released Webdings, they actually did embed
a secret message into it. With Webdings, if

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:25.510
you type in NYC, you get eye, heart, and a
city skyline.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:33.110
And number five: The Reptilianoids. The winner
of the most freakin’ stupid crazy conspiracy

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:37.700
of all time goes to the guy who came up with
the shape-shifting, blood-drinking humanoid

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:42.360
reptile aliens that have been ruling the human
race since the time of the pharaohs. Dave

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:49.569
Ick, or Icky—icky icky ptang zoop boing—former
professional soccer player and morning show

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:53.840
sportscaster, has many followers, including
the father of balloon boy Falcon Heene, who

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.340
believe that many of the most powerful people
in human history are, in fact, shape-shifting,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:02.220
blood-drinking reptilians from the constellation
Draco. The British royal family, most of America’s

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:07.220
presidents, and of course, Brad Pitt and Angelina
Jolie, all reptilians. They feed on human

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.370
guilt, fear, and aggression, and in order
to maintain their humanoid shape, they must

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.500
drink lots and lots of human blood. Here’s
a direct quote from his website: Al Gore,

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:21.870
vice president to Clinton, Illuminati, Satanist,
serious blood-drinker, and reptilian shape-shifter.

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.760
Those are my top five most ridiculous conspiracy
theories of all time. If, by chance, you thought

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:31.090
that some of those theories did not seem far-fetched,
I would request that you go see a therapist.

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.519
John, I’ll see you on Wednesday.

00:03:32.519 --> 00:03:36.010
End screen time! Thank you to my friend Jesslyn
Shields for helping me write and research

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.080
this. There’s a link to her blog in the
dooblydoo, and thank you to Toby of tobuscus

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.849
fan for the epic Toby voice in the intro.
Also one of my favorite books of the year,

00:03:43.849 --> 00:03:47.959
Shipbreaker, just won the Printz award, which
I’m very excited about. Congratulations

00:03:47.959 --> 00:03:52.040
to Paolo Bacigalupi, and there are other things
around me that you should go check out. Thank

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.340
you to nerdfighters for always being awesome.

